{
  "version": "1.3.0",
  "base_path": "/api/v1",
  "rules": [
    "Bearer session token",
    "Idempotency-Key required for business mutations; auth/login, auth/email-code, auth/register, auth/reset-password and auth/profile are exempt",
    "expected_version required for case actions",
    "money is integer CNY fen",
    "timestamps RFC3339 UTC",
    "401/403/409/422 never become demo successes",
    "network/5xx fallback to isolated local demo; unknown real writes retain original key and reconcile by reload; never replay demo writes",
    "Success is final 2xx; redirects are not success. File size limit 8 MiB. Production supports email-verified customer registration and fixed seed admin/customer identities.",
    "Shop products and orders use current schema 2; shop writes require stable Idempotency-Key and optimistic expected_version for edits/actions.",
    "PAYMENT_MODE defaults to mock; real rejects pay until a verified gateway is implemented. No client-success assertion marks a real order paid.",
    "DEMO_MODE is explicit; formal /shop-config never returns demo_credentials. Demo forces mock.",
    "Order requirements remain editable by their buyer until merchant acceptance; start or direct delivery locks editing atomically.",
    "Formal admin UI requires a valid admin login; explicit Demo auto-signs in as admin/1234. Offline data fallback never grants formal admin access."
  ],
  "login": {
    "method": "POST",
    "path": "/auth/login",
    "body": {
      "account": "bound email or username",
      "password": "configured by environment"
    },
    "response": {
      "token": "opaque token",
      "user": {
        "id": "customer",
        "name": "客户",
        "role": "customer",
        "avatar_url": "data:image/png;base64,...",
        "username": "customer",
        "email": "verified@example.test"
      }
    }
  },
